        config LWIP_DEFINE_LWIP_RAND_IN_CC_H
            bool
            default y
            help
                No prefix in generated macro
                Define LWIP_RAND macro in cc.h.
                It is difficult to properly define LWIP_RAND in Kconfig and having it always defined in cc.h would cause incompatible redefinition error in existing applications which define LWIP_RAND in a non-generated lwipopts.h file.

