                            answers for pending truncated questions. This value define the size of
                            the MDNS_PKTS mempool.
                            Up to MDNS_MAX_STORED_PKTS pbuf can be stored in addition to TC questions
                            that are pending.

                    config MDNS_OUTPUT_PACKET_SIZE
